  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest purchases cluster around metric fasteners and magnetic hooks, which suggest more specific fastening and hanging interests than general repair or electrical work.",
    "Recent purchases can satisfy a need, and my older hand truck purchase does not establish that I have another moving job now; I rarely act without a clear current use."
